ve cau tao
    - the du: day du cap the dong-mo
        exp: html, body
    - the rong: ko co the dong
        exp: meta


ve tinh chat
    - block
        la 1 block chiem 100% viewport
        exp:
            div
            h1 -> h6
            p
    - inline
        dung den dau thi rong den day, neu dai hon viewport -> xuong dong
        exp:
            span
            br
            img



SEO:
    - ngu nghia
    div, span ko co nghia gi ve seo


div:
    ko co y nghia ve SEO, ko co ngu nghia
    gom nhom cac thanh phan lai voi nhau


span:
    ko co ngu nghia



heading:
    h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 la cac the block
    nhan manh thong tin
        h1: manh nhat, một page chi nen co duy nhat 1 the h1
        co the co nhieu the h2, h3, h4, h5, h6
        ko dc nhay coc the
            vd: h1 -> h3 (sai), h3 -> h6 (sai)



p:
    la the block, su dung de trien khai 1 doan van ban, co khoang cach nhat dinh

br:
    xuong dong trong 1 doan van, la the inline, ko co ngu nghia j
    -> chi nen nam trong the p

img:
    hien thi anh, the rong (self-closing)
    src: duong dan anh
    alt: goi y hinh anh (neu anh loi thi hien alt)
    width: chieu rong anh
    height: chieo cao anh
    title: tieu de anh

ul,li va ol,li:
    tac dung: tao mot danh dach
    ul danh sach co cac dau cham trc cac muc
    ol danh sach co cac so trc cac muc

